ht. Just riddles wrapped in candlelight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who seek what lies askew, where stories murmur back to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570370/extras/c48537dfca8121448a9f6a20c9dd9b25.poster.avif?t=1769779557\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570370/extras/c48537dfca8121448a9f6a20c9dd9b25.webm?t=1769779557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bastinus Rex"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570370/4bf6296a123618ab090764986dd8ba574bd93e6b/header.jpg?t=1769779557","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 Mojave<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 6000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 750 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3570370/1597551205/a248eddfdafd7f33a7dbab89d6796d194a477f3f/1759760267/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759767975","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3570370/1597551205/a248eddfdafd7f33a7dbab89d6796d194a477f3f/1759760267/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759767975","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3570370/1597551205/a248eddfdafd7f33a7dbab89d6796d194a477f3f/1759760267/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759767975","id":257213014,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.st